# Response headers for app.chessever.com (Workers static assets; flutter
# build copies this file into build/web, and Workers parses it rather than
# serving it). Responses from web_worker/index.js (/_img) do not get these.
#
# Skwasm rasterizes on a Web Worker only when the page is cross-origin
# isolated; otherwise all drawing shares the main thread with the Dart code,
# and piece animations drop frames. COOP + COEP would isolate the page but
# also block the broadcast video panel's cross-origin iframes (YouTube,
# Twitch). Document-Isolation-Policy (Chrome 137+, the same floor as the Wasm
# build) isolates this document alone and places no requirement on iframes;
# credentialless loads no-CORS cross-origin resources without cookies.
# Firefox and Safari ignore it and keep running Skwasm single-threaded.
# web_boot.dart logs `cross-origin isolated: true|false` at startup.
/*
  Document-Isolation-Policy: isolate-and-credentialless
